[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5446613472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122852#issuecomment-5446613472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122852","id":5446613472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRKS54A","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T23:55:25Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T23:56:16Z","body":"This issue does not happen when the `rendering/viewport/hdr_2d` project setting is enabled.\n\nSetting the alpha value to `UV.x` helps give a little more insight to what is going on:\n\n|Compatibility HDR 2D off|Compatibility HDR 2D on| Compatibility HDR 2D off, no CanvasGroup\n--|--|--\n<img width=\"784\" height=\"778\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/36a8a011-7dd0-4d41-b7ec-c821f3d009b4\" />|<img width=\"850\" height=\"857\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b49edac-0300-4ceb-8f19-efc7fac0a001\" />|<img width=\"1251\" height=\"857\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e2132d2-6667-4b35-b1b3-581160a49a87\" />\n\nHopefully that helps narrow down whether this is a bug or a fundamental limitation with the way that Canvas Groups work in Compatibility when HDR 2D is disabled...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5446613472/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5446896456","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122852#issuecomment-5446896456","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122852","id":5446896456,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRKkLSA","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-28T00:35:31Z","updated_at":"2026-08-28T00:35:31Z","body":"FWIW, while working on a compatibility renderer canvas group PR a while back (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116783) I found that the default rt color image format is GL_RGB10_A2, GL_RGBA8 when viewport transparency